{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026l9UsxYWVrP1793745528.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>美元及債息上升，金價下跌。現貨金價曾跌逾百分之1，一度失守3,900美元一盎司。</p><p></p><p>至於紐約期金，收市報3,940.4美元一盎司，跌29.2美元，跌幅百分之0.74。</p><p></p><p>金價由今年初的高位回落近三成，美銀警告，通脹高企、聯邦儲備局在加息的壓力下，金價於第四季或持平於4,000美元，最壞的情況或下試3,750美元。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:20:58.051219+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":155,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T22:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T14:58:19.229075+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T23:18:22.522805+00:00","content_hash":"f88f2d7731a8424c41132c47b2a9188045f76b0ea24dca97af30723f46ef0241","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T23:20:58.051219+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}